---

Research Foundation:
This software implements concepts from "Repository Planning Graphs for Agentic 
Software Development" (arXiv:2509.16198). The research provides the theoretical 
foundation for graph-driven repository planning and generation.

AI Provider Integration:
This software integrates with third-party AI providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, 
Google, OpenRouter, GitHub Models) through their respective APIs. Users must 
provide their own API keys and comply with the terms of service of their 
chosen providers.

Data Privacy:
ZeroRepo does not store or transmit user API keys to its servers. All API keys 
are stored locally in the user's browser and transmitted directly to the 
respective AI providers.